# What ppcg has to report about this translation -- and what it must not.
#
# `rep` is written and read by name, so it is not a name the annotation
# had to invent.  A leading "!" is a claim that nothing matches: read by
# id object rather than by name, the line below is printed for every
# representative whether or not the source spells it.
!arena names never spelled in the source:.*rep
